A||||10||BOILERMAKER||2.8 hesitation resolved!!!!!!||||10||
Z||000000||BOILERMAKER||01-10-2000||08:54 AM||||Finally opened up the purse strings and went and bought a new MSD coil and new Plug Wires.  Mainly I bought these because I was going to use them on the new 3.1 I am working on and figured if they fix the 2.8 then that is great.  To my surprise as soon as they were installed and then engine was started I noticed a huge difference in the performance of the engine.<P>I used to have a hesitation at constant speeds ... gone!!!!!!!!!!<P>I recently developed a very annoying hesitation (almost backfiring) at any acceleration or velocity ... gone!!!!!!!!!!!<P>I am amazed and very very happy.  Also, my tack quit jumping (not much, but noticeable).  I am relieved.  <P>Just FYI for those having the same problems.||||reg||10
